{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"bfbf5018eff5420e7c18ead6222fac1eaaafa653fc0191300ebfbc854b9b7a54","ja":"最初はどうなるかと思いましたけど……\n計画通りに進みそうですね。よかった。","zh":"起初我还担心会变成什么样……看来能按计划进行下去了。太好了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"1284521547b786b3faa3155ca50a5b4be41bb725336e2238087232001ddb3370","ja":"くふふ、なんだかひみつの作戦みたいだね！\n明日の公演が楽しみだぞ～♪","zh":"嘿嘿，总觉得像是在执行秘密作战呢！\n好期待明天的公演啊～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"320a57c5dcc6f8605e97b4028e89a0bd8da67cff4b31dcb0c1e138fa3597dc03","ja":"せやな、これでひなたも……。","zh":"是啊，这样一来日向也……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"dd24b55e884e90f2b2d322bdefc3c7dfaf23bec0ae870fb58a2398b6eb88b7f1","ja":"……って、ひなた！？","zh":"……等等，日向！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"0b8faa5ca08bfb56c31b7922310d6609048f569d93dae9e8ee36a3487eb956fe","ja":"みんな、どうしたんだべさ？\nビックリした顔して……。","zh":"大家这是怎么了？\n一个个都露出惊讶的表情……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6cb496359600a0fa31d4308cfa80c544ef274812678944179a3f424d1bba0083","ja":"ええと……あ！　もうすぐ打ち合わせの時間やったな！\nそれで探してくれてたん？　ありがとな～。","zh":"呃……啊！马上就到开会时间了！所以你是在帮我找吗？谢谢啦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"16e1803cdcee15ec83705079c2c57dc21765333113783875fc21af3a740de199","ja":"う、うん。\nえっと、みんなは、何の話を……？","zh":"嗯、嗯。\n那个，大家在聊什么……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"19306e68ce28ce49dd0ec85c5d478c3187f422a4f8a946d2a0b5e28ccee496c9","ja":"ひみつの作……じゃなかった！\nええと、ええと～！","zh":"秘密的作……不对！\n呃，呃～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"12754cdf43a267946234cd996fd222ad004c074706c52200fad809e8f7112579","ja":"き、今日の夜ご飯はなんにしよかって話！\nな、環！　お好み焼きにしよか？","zh":"我、我是在说今天晚上吃什么啦！\n呐，环！吃大阪烧怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"77794cb7c7076071867e08d733d960015560d78b6e4fdee98dde3f181909a10a","ja":"う、うん！\nたまき、お好み焼きい～っぱい食べるぞ～！","zh":"嗯、嗯！\n环吃好多好多大阪烧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_994.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"4d98b1932641f41b4f78f2054ee1c9f715baa039c9ef8730088ad10d7ade2218","ja":"よしよし、いっぱい食べて育ってな～。\nほ、ほらひなたも！　打ち合わせ終わったら食べよっ！","zh":"乖乖，多吃点，快快长大哦～。\n来、来嘛，日向也是！等商谈结束后一起吃吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:28:34+00:00"}
